    LLM: "If everyone folds to you, betâ€”you might have the best hand. If you see several high cards on others' foreheads and they are betting, consider folding.\n\nUse opponents' reactions: if someone with a visible King hesitates, they may be worried you have an Ace. Bluff by betting confidently when others show weakness.\n\nIn match-pot, simultaneous declaration creates a game theory puzzle: two players with high cards may both drop, letting a lower hand win. Predict and exploit.",
